            <description><![CDATA[<h2>订阅导入兼容 / Subscription imports</h2><p>新增 Stash、Clash、Surge、Hiddify、Loon、sing-box 导入链接解析。不新增自动发现，流量取决于服务商数据。Adds documented client import-link parsing; no new automatic discovery. Provider quota metadata is required.</p><p>Apple silicon 测试版，Developer ID 签名，尚未 Apple 公证。Apple silicon prerelease, Developer ID signed, not notarized.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/mustundead/ByteKibble/releases/tag/v1.2.0-build49">完整更新说明 / Full release notes</a></p>]]></description>
